#: sections/layers.py:203
msgid ""
"Each hazard topic is flagged at the pixel level when its threshold is exceeded. For topics with "
"multiple layers (e.g. Drought combines agricultural and meteorological drought), an OR union is "
"applied across layers before flagging. MHC then counts how many topics flag each pixel; only "
"pixels reaching the user-selected minimum count N are displayed."
msgstr ""
"当某个灾害主题超过其阈值时，即在像元级别对其进行标记。对于包含多个图层的主题（如干旱综合了农业干旱和气象干旱），在标记前对各图层进行“或”合并。随后 MHC "
"统计每个像元被标记的主题数量；仅显示达到用户所选最小数量 N 的像元。"

# Draft (machine-assisted) - needs native review
#: config/elnino.py:796
msgid ""
"Each period comes from one monthly forecast issue, named with it. A newer issue replaces an older"
" one for any month both cover, so figures for the same month can change from one issue to the "
"next. Periods are withdrawn once their months have passed: past months are observed, not "
"forecast."
