# Draft (machine-assisted) - needs native review
#: config/elnino.py:981
msgid ""
"Observed sea-surface temperature anomaly in the Niño 3.4 region, from NOAA OISST — independent of"
" the rainfall forecast. It shows whether an El Niño is actually underway. It does NOT prove the "
"forecast signal is caused by one: the forecast is the model's net response to every initial "
"condition it was given, and ENSO is never isolated within it. For the empirical check, compare "
"the map against the El Niño rainfall fingerprint layer."
msgstr ""
"Niño 3.4 区观测海表温度距平，来自 NOAA OISST——独立于降水预报。它显示厄尔尼诺是否确实正在发生。它并不能证明预报信号由其引起：预报是模式对其所有初始条件的综合响应，ENSO "
"从未在其中被单独分离。如需经验检验，请将地图与厄尔尼诺降水特征图层对照。"

# Draft (machine-assisted) - needs native review
#: sections/elnino_export.py:253
msgid ""
"Of the children in the signal area. The rest may be unusual for other reasons. Consistency with "
"El Niño is not proof of cause."
