#: config/hazards.py:433
msgid ""
"SPEI adds the effect of evapotranspiration and is better suited to assess droughts under climate "
"change scenarios where temperature changes are important. Probability values are computed from "
"the full 1958–2025 record (804 monthly time steps)."
msgstr "SPEI 增加了蒸散的影响，更适合评估温度变化显著的气候变化情景下的干旱。概率值根据 1958–2025 年完整记录（804 个月度时间步长）计算。"

#: config/hazards.py:426
msgid ""
"SPI measures the deviation of precipitation from the climatological average over a given "
"accumulation period and is widely used to detect and characterize meteorological droughts. "
"Probability values are computed from the full 1958–2025 record (804 monthly time steps)."
msgstr "SPI 衡量给定累积期内降水量相对于气候平均值的偏离程度，被广泛用于识别和描述气象干旱。概率值根据 1958–2025 年完整记录（804 个月度时间步长）计算。"

