# Draft (machine-assisted) - needs native review
#: config/elnino.py:780
msgid ""
"Seasonal skill is regional. SEAS5 predicts well where ENSO teleconnections are strong and barely "
"at all elsewhere, so two equal-looking signals are not equally trustworthy. Check the skill layer"
" before relying on a figure; it is reported alongside each result but is NOT applied to it. Read "
"it as a generous estimate: the correlation grades how well the model ranks wet and dry years, "
"which is an easier test than whether the probabilities themselves verify. A region can correlate "
"respectably and still add little over guessing."
msgstr ""
"季节预报技巧因地区而异。SEAS5 在 ENSO "
"遥相关强的地区预报良好，在其他地区几乎没有技巧，因此两个看似相同的信号可信度并不相同。依赖某个数字前请查看技巧图层；它随每个结果一并报告，但并未应用于结果。应视之为宽松估计：相关系数衡量的是模式对干湿年份排序的能力，这比概率本身能否得到验证更容易通过。某地区可能相关性尚可，却几乎不比随机猜测好。"

