#: config/elnino.py:759
msgid ""
"Separately, the model's {hindcast} hindcast is compared against observations per grid cell: "
"rainfall against {reference}, temperature against ERA5-Land. The correlation asks whether the "
"forecast's seasonal average tracked reality year to year, which is what tells you where the model"
" has a historical track record. It adjusts no figure — it is reported beside each result so a "
"signal from a well-predicted region can be told from one that is not."
msgstr ""
"另外，将模式 {hindcast} 回报逐格点与观测比较：降水对比 {reference}，气温对比 "
"ERA5-Land。相关系数反映预报季节平均值是否逐年跟随实际，据此可知模式在哪里有可靠的历史表现。它不修正任何数字——随每个结果一并报告，以便区分来自预报良好地区的信号与其他信号。"

